  "ports": [
    "LoadOrJoinMenu: separate Start Game and Join Game panels, Create New World first, five rows per list.",
    "The unnamed depth-one FJ_Panel9Grid is the opaque raised backing behind both fading recesses.",
    "Java omits the platform storage meter/footer; its fitted frame repeats the source top inset below both recesses.",
    "ListButton_Norm is drawn with its original untinted RGB, without the normal-button 67-percent brightness multiplier.",
    "FJ_ButtonList uses zero row spacing, independent list selections, bounded scrolling and cross-list navigation.",
    "SettingsOptionsMenu checkbox rows are 30/45 source pixels apart (15 logical); SettingsUI normally uses 36/54 (18 logical).",
    "The requested existing blue highlight and native Java server/address workflows are retained."
  ]
}
